# Dwarven Hold enters tapped, stores once per kept-tapped upkeep, then spends one counter for one red mana (CR 603.4, 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Dwarven Hold
Island x25
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x25
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Dwarven Hold.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.Untap]
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Counters.Storage = 1
[T5 Bot1.Untap]
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Counters.Storage = 2
[T7 Bot1.Untap]
Bot1.Accept
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Counters.Storage = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Activate(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Hold.Counters.Storage = 1
